<title>USA: San Anselmo, Calif., won by Dean Witter.</title>
<headline>San Anselmo, Calif., won by Dean Witter.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dean Witter said it won $3.550 million of San Anselmo, Calif., general obligation bonds, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.257 percent.</p>
